bring _fremmed.tung
bring flock/algebra/whole/hath_fold.tung
bring ilk/kindful.tung
bring ilk/one.tung

## a non-normalised span meted in milliseconds.
show ilk _milliseconds: * { milliseconds: [ℕ, _milliseconds] }

show let seconds: [t: ℕ, _milliseconds] ≔ t · 1000 $ milliseconds

show let minutes: [t: ℕ, _milliseconds] ≔ t · 60 $ seconds

show let hours: [t: ℕ, _milliseconds] ≔ t · 60 $ minutes

show let sleep_for: [(t milliseconds): _milliseconds, 𝟙 deed] ≔ t sleep
